WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.916
What you type into an AI tool may be stored. Let's keep you and others safe.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:10.870
Never share passwords, mobile money PINs or one-time codes.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.812
Keep ID numbers, bank details and home addresses private.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:21.263
And never paste private information about students, patients or customers.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:26.955
AI can copy a person's voice or face. Scammers use this to ask for money.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.716
If a familiar voice asks for money urgently, call them back on a number you know.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:46.714
Before you move on, check: Keep PINs, passwords and ID numbers out of AI tools. Call back before sending money on a voice request. Check the privacy settings of an AI tool you use.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:50.598
In the next lesson: Your AI project.
